              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nancy Thorgaard"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My mother used to make these but would grind the Spam, some American cheese, AND some onion and green pepper using one of those old meat grinders you clamp to the table. The texture is more even and becomes spreadable. So I went and found an unused, old meat grinder and tonight we're having \"Mom's Spamwiches.\" I can almost taste them already!",
